      "description": "<p>More than 200 arrested while teachers join protest over class sizes, exhausting timetables and staff shortages</p><p>French teenagers blockading their schools in protest at class sizes, teacher shortages and long timetables have clashed with police, as politicians traded verbal blows over how to respond.</p><p>Demonstrations that began in Paris last week have escalated and spread across France, with the authorities reporting the arrests of 164 people on Monday.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/29/french-students-police-clash-school-blockades-violent\">Continue reading...</a>",
